CORE
main.go
--unwind 3 --unwinding-assertions
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^\[go::main\.main\.panic\.5\] line 42 panic: expected failure: FAILURE$
^\*\* 1 of \d+ failed
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
unwinding assertion.*: FAILURE
^warning: ignoring
--
Elements are copied by __CPROVER_array_copy and __CPROVER_array_replace,
whose byte operators are lowered element by element between arrays of the
same element type, so pointers keep what they point to.
